Bug 2061214 - Save new calendar events from the new calendar event dialog. r=#thunderbird-front-end-reviewers

Validate the current create draft and save it to the selected calendar. Retain values after failure, support retry and Undo/Redo, and keep replacement sessions unchanged.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332899


